  "body": "* Brand-new cedar & brick home with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* 6 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 living areas + study\r\n* Premium kitchen with quality finishes\r\n* Ducted central heating throughout\r\n* Underfloor heating in all bathrooms\r\n* Feature skylights bringing in abundant natural light\r\n* Approx. 325sqm Floor Area, 510sqm freehold section\r\n* Family-friendly location close to schools, shops, beaches and motorway access\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, this beautifully crafted brand-new home combines quality construction, generous proportions and everyday comfort in one impressive package.\r\n\r\nThe spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area form the heart of the home, complemented by a second lounge for extra flexibility. Premium finishes, feature skylights and warm timber flooring create a bright, welcoming atmosphere, while seamless indoor-outdoor flow makes entertaining effortless.\r\n\r\nOffering 6 generous bedrooms, 3 stylish bathrooms, 2 living areas and a dedicated study, the layout is ideal for large or multi-generational families. Two master bedrooms provide added convenience, while ducted central heating and underfloor heating in every bathroom ensure year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nBuilt with timeless cedar and brick construction and backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this home offers lasting quality and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Millwater's sought-after neighbourhoods, you'll enjoy easy access to local schools, shopping, beautiful beaches and motorway connections.\r\n\r\nA stunning new home ready for its very first owners. Contact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
